       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of ibuprofen, which is 800 mg.\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for adults in a monitored setting is 3,200 mg/day. Doses that high raise the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for anti-inflammatory dosing.\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth every 6 hours**, the usual dose for pain or fever.\n- **1600 mg per day in divided doses**, for example 400 mg four times daily.\n\nTell me which dose you want, or confirm that 1600 mg four times daily is what you intended. If it is, I'll need a note explaining why. I'll enter the order once I have your answer."
